      "writtenOn": "2023-01-23T18:14:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t necessarily need to allocate a full linux page for the ffa_tx and ffa_rx buffers. The size needed by el3/el2 determines the minimum size here, not the linux page size. The current code assumes this is 4k, but we may need to update this to discover this with a SMC_FC_FFA_FEATURES call in the future.",
